2026-07-27T09:50:53.9722257Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:50:53.9722873Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:50:53.9723382Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:50:53.9724214Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:50:53.9725428Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:50:53.9726793Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
